      "content": "but you don't get it. it wasn't just a \"mistake.\" it was a choice. a series of choices that i made because i was being careless and selfish. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person anymore, i just see the person who ruined everything for everyone else. how am i supposed to just \"grow\" from that? how do you fix something that's just fundamentally rotten at the core?",
