      "content": "rebuilding from ashes sounds nice in a movie but in reality it just feels like dragging around a corpse. i feel like i'm just a burden to everyone i meet now. the more i try to \"fix\" it, the more i realize that some things are just beyond repair. maybe some things are just meant to stay broken. maybe the only thing that actually makes sense is just... stopping. stopping the damage, stopping the lies, stopping all of it.",
